 R←Test_Misc_003(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;CR;LF;secret;text;expected
⍝ Exercise `MaskSecretHeaders`
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 (CR LF)←⎕UCS 13 10
 secret←##.Plodder.SecretHeaders

 →T.PassesIf''≡secret ##.Plodder.MaskSecretHeaders''

 text←'GET /foo HTTP/1.1',CR,LF,'Host: localhost',CR,LF,'Authorization: Bearer 4711',CR,LF
 text,←'api-key : 0815',CR,LF,CR,LF,'body: stays'
 expected←'GET /foo HTTP/1.1',CR,LF,'Host: localhost',CR,LF,'Authorization: ***',CR,LF
 expected,←'api-key : ***',CR,LF,CR,LF,'body: stays'
 →T.PassesIf expected≡secret ##.Plodder.MaskSecretHeaders text

 →T.PassesIf'Cookie: ***'≡secret ##.Plodder.MaskSecretHeaders'Cookie: a=1'
 →T.PassesIf(LF,LF,'x')≡secret ##.Plodder.MaskSecretHeaders LF,LF,'x'

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
